<title>UK: MOTORCYCLING-DOOHAN WINS WORLD TITLE.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-DOOHAN WINS WORLD TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>DONINGTON PARK, England 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Michael Doohan won the British 500cc motorcycle Grand Prix on Sunday to claim his fourth consecutive world title.</p>
<p>Tadayuki Okada of Japan was second and Brazilian Alex Barros third.</p>
</text>
